{"id":"86e53aa076639692","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-beck-chevalley.md","title":"显式换基 mates","display":"df-beck-chevalley — 显式换基 mates","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","label":"16-df-beck-chevalley","aliases":["16-df-beck-chevalley","Beck-Chevalley condition"],"display":"df-beck-chevalley — 显式换基 mates","depends_on":["[[16-df-adjoint-functors]]","[[16-df-general-quantifier]]","[[16-df-pullback-square]]","[[16-thm-substitution-functoriality]]"],"source":"Definition 1.9.1 pp. 94–95 (PDF 114–115); Definition 1.9.4 p. 97 (PDF 117); §9.3","revision_date":"2026-10-20"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-beck-chevalley"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-beck-chevalley</span><span>Beck-Chevalley condition</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-beck-chevalley — 显式换基 mates"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a88937ea87ff8530\" href=\"?note=a88937ea87ff8530\" title=\"16-df-adjoint-functors\">16-df-adjoint-functors</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ef7efb192e321ef0\" href=\"?note=ef7efb192e321ef0\" title=\"16-df-general-quantifier\">16-df-general-quantifier</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"dacf0503b95c88a9\" href=\"?note=dacf0503b95c88a9\" title=\"16-df-pullback-square\">16-df-pullback-square</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"298460dd9013dccf\" href=\"?note=298460dd9013dccf\" title=\"16-thm-substitution-functoriality\">16-thm-substitution-functoriality</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Definition 1.9.1 pp. 94–95 (PDF 114–115); Definition 1.9.4 p. 97 (PDF 117); §9.3"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-20"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B\">\\(p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B\\)</span> 为带提升选择的纤维化；重索引与伴随采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ef7efb192e321ef0\" href=\"?note=ef7efb192e321ef0\" title=\"16-df-general-quantifier\">16-df-general-quantifier</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"a88937ea87ff8530\" href=\"?note=a88937ea87ff8530\" title=\"16-df-adjoint-functors\">16-df-adjoint-functors</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S=(u&#39;,v&#39;,v,u)\">\\(S=(u&#39;,v&#39;,v,u)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u&#39;:I&#39;\\to J&#39;\">\\(u&#39;:I&#39;\\to J&#39;\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v&#39;:I&#39;\\to I\">\\(v&#39;:I&#39;\\to I\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v:J&#39;\\to J\">\\(v:J&#39;\\to J\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u:I\\to J\">\\(u:I\\to J\\)</span>，满足 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"dacf0503b95c88a9\" href=\"?note=dacf0503b95c88a9\" title=\"16-df-pullback-square\">16-df-pullback-square</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PbSq}_{\\mathcal B}(u&#39;,v&#39;;v,u)\">\\(\\mathrm{PbSq}_{\\mathcal B}(u&#39;,v&#39;;v,u)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c_{a,b}\">\\(c_{a,b}\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"298460dd9013dccf\" href=\"?note=298460dd9013dccf\" title=\"16-thm-substitution-functoriality\">16-thm-substitution-functoriality</a> 的重索引相干同构。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L,R:\\mathcal E_{J&#39;}\\to\\mathcal E_J\">\\(L,R:\\mathcal E_{J&#39;}\\to\\mathcal E_J\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L&#39;,R&#39;:\\mathcal E_{I&#39;}\\to\\mathcal E_I\">\\(L&#39;,R&#39;:\\mathcal E_{I&#39;}\\to\\mathcal E_I\\)</span> 为候选函子，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi,\\Phi&#39;,\\Psi,\\Psi&#39;\">\\(\\Phi,\\Phi&#39;,\\Psi,\\Psi&#39;\\)</span> 为相应 Hom 映射族。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta^\\Phi,\\epsilon^\\Phi\">\\(\\eta^\\Phi,\\epsilon^\\Phi\\)</span> 等取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"a88937ea87ff8530\" href=\"?note=a88937ea87ff8530\" title=\"16-df-adjoint-functors\">16-df-adjoint-functors</a> 的公式；含它们的 mate 仅在对应 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AdjHom}\">\\(\\mathrm{AdjHom}\\)</span> 条件成立时定义。</li>\n<li>数据参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(L&#39;,\\Phi&#39;,L,\\Phi)\">\\((L&#39;,\\Phi&#39;,L,\\Phi)\\)</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(R&#39;,\\Psi&#39;,R,\\Psi)\">\\((R&#39;,\\Psi&#39;,R,\\Psi)\\)</span> 属于公式本身。历史二参数记号仅在已指定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_w\\dashv w^*\\dashv\\Pi_w\">\\(\\Sigma_w\\dashv w^*\\dashv\\Pi_w\\)</span> 及其 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi^{\\Sigma,w},\\Phi^{\\Pi,w}\">\\(\\Phi^{\\Sigma,w},\\Phi^{\\Pi,w}\\)</span> 时使用，按下式实例化；不从伴随存在谓词中取未绑定见证。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_{J&#39;}\">\\(A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_{J&#39;}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_J\">\\(Z\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_J\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{PB}(\\mathcal B)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\bigcup_{I&#39;,J&#39;,I,J\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B}\n\\left\\{(u&#39;,v&#39;,v,u)\\in\n\\mathcal B(I&#39;,J&#39;)\\times\\mathcal B(I&#39;,I)\\times\\mathcal B(J&#39;,J)\\times\\mathcal B(I,J)\n\\ \\middle|\\ \\mathrm{PbSq}_{\\mathcal B}(u&#39;,v&#39;;v,u)\\right\\},\\\\\n\\theta_{S,Z}&amp;\\coloneqq c_{u&#39;,v,Z}^{-1}\\circ c_{v&#39;,u,Z},\\\\\n\\beta^\\Sigma_{S,A}(L&#39;,\\Phi&#39;,L,\\Phi)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\epsilon^{\\Phi&#39;}_{u^*LA}\\circ L&#39;\\bigl(\\theta^{-1}_{S,LA}\\circ(u&#39;)^*\\eta^\\Phi_A\\bigr),\\\\\n\\beta^\\Pi_{S,A}(R&#39;,\\Psi&#39;,R,\\Psi)&amp;\\coloneqq\nR&#39;\\bigl((u&#39;)^*\\epsilon^\\Psi_A\\circ\\theta_{S,RA}\\bigr)\\circ\\eta^{\\Psi&#39;}_{u^*RA}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{PB}(\\mathcal B)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\bigcup_{I&#39;,J&#39;,I,J\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B}\n\\left\\{(u&#39;,v&#39;,v,u)\\in\n\\mathcal B(I&#39;,J&#39;)\\times\\mathcal B(I&#39;,I)\\times\\mathcal B(J&#39;,J)\\times\\mathcal B(I,J)\n\\ \\middle|\\ \\mathrm{PbSq}_{\\mathcal B}(u&#39;,v&#39;;v,u)\\right\\},\\\\\n\\theta_{S,Z}&amp;\\coloneqq c_{u&#39;,v,Z}^{-1}\\circ c_{v&#39;,u,Z},\\\\\n\\beta^\\Sigma_{S,A}(L&#39;,\\Phi&#39;,L,\\Phi)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\epsilon^{\\Phi&#39;}_{u^*LA}\\circ L&#39;\\bigl(\\theta^{-1}_{S,LA}\\circ(u&#39;)^*\\eta^\\Phi_A\\bigr),\\\\\n\\beta^\\Pi_{S,A}(R&#39;,\\Psi&#39;,R,\\Psi)&amp;\\coloneqq\nR&#39;\\bigl((u&#39;)^*\\epsilon^\\Psi_A\\circ\\theta_{S,RA}\\bigr)\\circ\\eta^{\\Psi&#39;}_{u^*RA}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{BC}_\\Sigma(p;S;L&#39;,\\Phi&#39;,L,\\Phi)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\begin{cases}\n(\\forall A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_{J&#39;})\\\n\\mathrm{Iso}_{\\mathcal E_I}\\bigl(\\beta^\\Sigma_{S,A}(L&#39;,\\Phi&#39;,L,\\Phi)\\bigr)\n&amp;\\mathrm{AdjHom}(L&#39;,(v&#39;)^*,\\Phi&#39;)\\land\\mathrm{AdjHom}(L,v^*,\\Phi),\\\\\n\\bot&amp;\\neg\\bigl(\\mathrm{AdjHom}(L&#39;,(v&#39;)^*,\\Phi&#39;)\\land\\mathrm{AdjHom}(L,v^*,\\Phi)\\bigr),\n\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\mathrm{BC}_\\Pi(p;S;R&#39;,\\Psi&#39;,R,\\Psi)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\begin{cases}\n(\\forall A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_{J&#39;})\\\n\\mathrm{Iso}_{\\mathcal E_I}\\bigl(\\beta^\\Pi_{S,A}(R&#39;,\\Psi&#39;,R,\\Psi)\\bigr)\n&amp;\\mathrm{AdjHom}((v&#39;)^*,R&#39;,\\Psi&#39;)\\land\\mathrm{AdjHom}(v^*,R,\\Psi),\\\\\n\\bot&amp;\\neg\\bigl(\\mathrm{AdjHom}((v&#39;)^*,R&#39;,\\Psi&#39;)\\land\\mathrm{AdjHom}(v^*,R,\\Psi)\\bigr).\n\\end{cases}\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{BC}_\\Sigma(p;S;L&#39;,\\Phi&#39;,L,\\Phi)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\begin{cases}\n(\\forall A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_{J&#39;})\\\n\\mathrm{Iso}_{\\mathcal E_I}\\bigl(\\beta^\\Sigma_{S,A}(L&#39;,\\Phi&#39;,L,\\Phi)\\bigr)\n&amp;\\mathrm{AdjHom}(L&#39;,(v&#39;)^*,\\Phi&#39;)\\land\\mathrm{AdjHom}(L,v^*,\\Phi),\\\\\n\\bot&amp;\\neg\\bigl(\\mathrm{AdjHom}(L&#39;,(v&#39;)^*,\\Phi&#39;)\\land\\mathrm{AdjHom}(L,v^*,\\Phi)\\bigr),\n\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\mathrm{BC}_\\Pi(p;S;R&#39;,\\Psi&#39;,R,\\Psi)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\begin{cases}\n(\\forall A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_{J&#39;})\\\n\\mathrm{Iso}_{\\mathcal E_I}\\bigl(\\beta^\\Pi_{S,A}(R&#39;,\\Psi&#39;,R,\\Psi)\\bigr)\n&amp;\\mathrm{AdjHom}((v&#39;)^*,R&#39;,\\Psi&#39;)\\land\\mathrm{AdjHom}(v^*,R,\\Psi),\\\\\n\\bot&amp;\\neg\\bigl(\\mathrm{AdjHom}((v&#39;)^*,R&#39;,\\Psi&#39;)\\land\\mathrm{AdjHom}(v^*,R,\\Psi)\\bigr).\n\\end{cases}\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\beta^\\Sigma_{S,A}&amp;\\coloneqq\\beta^\\Sigma_{S,A}(\\Sigma_{v&#39;},\\Phi^{\\Sigma,v&#39;},\\Sigma_v,\\Phi^{\\Sigma,v}),\\\\\n\\beta^\\Pi_{S,A}&amp;\\coloneqq\\beta^\\Pi_{S,A}(\\Pi_{v&#39;},\\Phi^{\\Pi,v&#39;},\\Pi_v,\\Phi^{\\Pi,v}),\\\\\n\\mathrm{BC}_\\Sigma(p;S)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{BC}_\\Sigma(p;S;\\Sigma_{v&#39;},\\Phi^{\\Sigma,v&#39;},\\Sigma_v,\\Phi^{\\Sigma,v}),\\\\\n\\mathrm{BC}_\\Pi(p;S)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{BC}_\\Pi(p;S;\\Pi_{v&#39;},\\Phi^{\\Pi,v&#39;},\\Pi_v,\\Phi^{\\Pi,v}).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\beta^\\Sigma_{S,A}&amp;\\coloneqq\\beta^\\Sigma_{S,A}(\\Sigma_{v&#39;},\\Phi^{\\Sigma,v&#39;},\\Sigma_v,\\Phi^{\\Sigma,v}),\\\\\n\\beta^\\Pi_{S,A}&amp;\\coloneqq\\beta^\\Pi_{S,A}(\\Pi_{v&#39;},\\Phi^{\\Pi,v&#39;},\\Pi_v,\\Phi^{\\Pi,v}),\\\\\n\\mathrm{BC}_\\Sigma(p;S)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{BC}_\\Sigma(p;S;\\Sigma_{v&#39;},\\Phi^{\\Sigma,v&#39;},\\Sigma_v,\\Phi^{\\Sigma,v}),\\\\\n\\mathrm{BC}_\\Pi(p;S)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{BC}_\\Pi(p;S;\\Pi_{v&#39;},\\Phi^{\\Pi,v&#39;},\\Pi_v,\\Phi^{\\Pi,v}).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{BC}(p)\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\exists(\\Sigma_w,\\Pi_w,\\Phi^{\\Sigma,w},\\Phi^{\\Pi,w})_{w\\in\\operatorname{Mor}\\mathcal B})\\Bigl[{}&amp;\n(\\forall w)\\ \\mathrm{AdjHom}(\\Sigma_w,w^*,\\Phi^{\\Sigma,w})\\land\\mathrm{AdjHom}(w^*,\\Pi_w,\\Phi^{\\Pi,w})\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\forall S=(u&#39;,v&#39;,v,u)\\in\\operatorname{PB}(\\mathcal B))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\mathrm{BC}_\\Sigma(p;S;\\Sigma_{v&#39;},\\Phi^{\\Sigma,v&#39;},\\Sigma_v,\\Phi^{\\Sigma,v})\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{BC}_\\Pi(p;S;\\Pi_{v&#39;},\\Phi^{\\Pi,v&#39;},\\Pi_v,\\Phi^{\\Pi,v})\\Bigr],\\\\\n\\mathsf{BC}(p)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{BC}(p).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{BC}(p)\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\exists(\\Sigma_w,\\Pi_w,\\Phi^{\\Sigma,w},\\Phi^{\\Pi,w})_{w\\in\\operatorname{Mor}\\mathcal B})\\Bigl[{}&amp;\n(\\forall w)\\ \\mathrm{AdjHom}(\\Sigma_w,w^*,\\Phi^{\\Sigma,w})\\land\\mathrm{AdjHom}(w^*,\\Pi_w,\\Phi^{\\Pi,w})\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\forall S=(u&#39;,v&#39;,v,u)\\in\\operatorname{PB}(\\mathcal B))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\mathrm{BC}_\\Sigma(p;S;\\Sigma_{v&#39;},\\Phi^{\\Sigma,v&#39;},\\Sigma_v,\\Phi^{\\Sigma,v})\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{BC}_\\Pi(p;S;\\Pi_{v&#39;},\\Phi^{\\Pi,v&#39;},\\Pi_v,\\Phi^{\\Pi,v})\\Bigr],\\\\\n\\mathsf{BC}(p)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{BC}(p).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>左 mate 的源靶为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L&#39;(u&#39;)^*A\\to u^*LA\">\\(L&#39;(u&#39;)^*A\\to u^*LA\\)</span>，右 mate 的源靶为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u^*RA\\to R&#39;(u&#39;)^*A\">\\(u^*RA\\to R&#39;(u&#39;)^*A\\)</span>。伴随单位、余单位和换基同构的每次使用均由显式参数决定。旧记号保留为已选结构的缩写，全局存在性质则独立量化整族数据。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PB}(\\mathcal B)\">\\(\\operatorname{PB}(\\mathcal B)\\)</span> 先按四个顶点的 Hom 域筛选方块，再调用拉回谓词；不把任意四条不相接的箭头代入仅对方块有定义的复合公式。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 1.9.1、Definition 1.9.4 与 §9.3。这里补写数据作用域，没有增加量词存在或换基可逆性的额外条件。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-adjoint-functors","status":"resolved","id":"a88937ea87ff8530","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-adjoint-functors]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-general-quantifier","status":"resolved","id":"ef7efb192e321ef0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-general-quantifier]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-pullback-square","status":"resolved","id":"dacf0503b95c88a9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-pullback-square]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-thm-substitution-functoriality","status":"resolved","id":"298460dd9013dccf","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-thm-substitution-functoriality]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-general-quantifier","status":"resolved","id":"ef7efb192e321ef0","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$ 为带提升选择的纤维化；重索引与伴随采用 [[16-df-general-quantifier]]、[[16-df-adjoint-functors]]。$S=(u',v',v,u)$，$u':I'\\to J'$、$v':I'\\to I$、$v:J'\\to J$、$u:I\\to J$，满足 [[16-df-pullback-square]] 的 $\\mathrm{PbSq}_{\\mathcal B}(u',v';v,u)$。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-adjoint-functors","status":"resolved","id":"a88937ea87ff8530","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$ 为带提升选择的纤维化；重索引与伴随采用 [[16-df-general-quantifier]]、[[16-df-adjoint-functors]]。$S=(u',v',v,u)$，$u':I'\\to J'$、$v':I'\\to I$、$v:J'\\to J$、$u:I\\to J$，满足 [[16-df-pullback-square]] 的 $\\mathrm{PbSq}_{\\mathcal B}(u',v';v,u)$。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-pullback-square","status":"resolved","id":"dacf0503b95c88a9","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$ 为带提升选择的纤维化；重索引与伴随采用 [[16-df-general-quantifier]]、[[16-df-adjoint-functors]]。$S=(u',v',v,u)$，$u':I'\\to J'$、$v':I'\\to I$、$v:J'\\to J$、$u:I\\to J$，满足 [[16-df-pullback-square]] 的 $\\mathrm{PbSq}_{\\mathcal B}(u',v';v,u)$。","embed":false},{"target":"16-thm-substitution-functoriality","status":"resolved","id":"298460dd9013dccf","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$c_{a,b}$ 是 [[16-thm-substitution-functoriality]] 的重索引相干同构。$L,R:\\mathcal E_{J'}\\to\\mathcal E_J$、$L',R':\\mathcal E_{I'}\\to\\mathcal E_I$ 为候选函子，$\\Phi,\\Phi',\\Psi,\\Psi'$ 为相应 Hom 映射族。$\\eta^\\Phi,\\epsilon^\\Phi$ 等取 [[16-df-adjoint-functors]] 的公式；含它们的 mate 仅在对应 $\\mathrm{AdjHom}$ 条件成立时定义。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-adjoint-functors","status":"resolved","id":"a88937ea87ff8530","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$c_{a,b}$ 是 [[16-thm-substitution-functoriality]] 的重索引相干同构。$L,R:\\mathcal E_{J'}\\to\\mathcal E_J$、$L',R':\\mathcal E_{I'}\\to\\mathcal E_I$ 为候选函子，$\\Phi,\\Phi',\\Psi,\\Psi'$ 为相应 Hom 映射族。$\\eta^\\Phi,\\epsilon^\\Phi$ 等取 [[16-df-adjoint-functors]] 的公式；含它们的 mate 仅在对应 $\\mathrm{AdjHom}$ 条件成立时定义。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"S=(u',v',v,u)","display":false},{"tex":"u':I'\\to J'","display":false},{"tex":"v':I'\\to I","display":false},{"tex":"v:J'\\to J","display":false},{"tex":"u:I\\to J","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PbSq}_{\\mathcal B}(u',v';v,u)","display":false},{"tex":"c_{a,b}","display":false},{"tex":"L,R:\\mathcal E_{J'}\\to\\mathcal E_J","display":false},{"tex":"L',R':\\mathcal E_{I'}\\to\\mathcal E_I","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi,\\Phi',\\Psi,\\Psi'","display":false},{"tex":"\\eta^\\Phi,\\epsilon^\\Phi","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AdjHom}","display":false},{"tex":"(L',\\Phi',L,\\Phi)","display":false},{"tex":"(R',\\Psi',R,\\Psi)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_w\\dashv w^*\\dashv\\Pi_w","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi^{\\Sigma,w},\\Phi^{\\Pi,w}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_{J'}","display":false},{"tex":"Z\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_J","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{PB}(\\mathcal B)&\\coloneqq\n\\bigcup_{I',J',I,J\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B}\n\\left\\{(u',v',v,u)\\in\n\\mathcal B(I',J')\\times\\mathcal B(I',I)\\times\\mathcal B(J',J)\\times\\mathcal B(I,J)\n\\ \\middle|\\ \\mathrm{PbSq}_{\\mathcal B}(u',v';v,u)\\right\\},\\\\\n\\theta_{S,Z}&\\coloneqq c_{u',v,Z}^{-1}\\circ c_{v',u,Z},\\\\\n\\beta^\\Sigma_{S,A}(L',\\Phi',L,\\Phi)&\\coloneqq\n\\epsilon^{\\Phi'}_{u^*LA}\\circ L'\\bigl(\\theta^{-1}_{S,LA}\\circ(u')^*\\eta^\\Phi_A\\bigr),\\\\\n\\beta^\\Pi_{S,A}(R',\\Psi',R,\\Psi)&\\coloneqq\nR'\\bigl((u')^*\\epsilon^\\Psi_A\\circ\\theta_{S,RA}\\bigr)\\circ\\eta^{\\Psi'}_{u^*RA}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{BC}_\\Sigma(p;S;L',\\Phi',L,\\Phi)&\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\begin{cases}\n(\\forall A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_{J'})\\\n\\mathrm{Iso}_{\\mathcal E_I}\\bigl(\\beta^\\Sigma_{S,A}(L',\\Phi',L,\\Phi)\\bigr)\n&\\mathrm{AdjHom}(L',(v')^*,\\Phi')\\land\\mathrm{AdjHom}(L,v^*,\\Phi),\\\\\n\\bot&\\neg\\bigl(\\mathrm{AdjHom}(L',(v')^*,\\Phi')\\land\\mathrm{AdjHom}(L,v^*,\\Phi)\\bigr),\n\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\mathrm{BC}_\\Pi(p;S;R',\\Psi',R,\\Psi)&\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\begin{cases}\n(\\forall A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_{J'})\\\n\\mathrm{Iso}_{\\mathcal E_I}\\bigl(\\beta^\\Pi_{S,A}(R',\\Psi',R,\\Psi)\\bigr)\n&\\mathrm{AdjHom}((v')^*,R',\\Psi')\\land\\mathrm{AdjHom}(v^*,R,\\Psi),\\\\\n\\bot&\\neg\\bigl(\\mathrm{AdjHom}((v')^*,R',\\Psi')\\land\\mathrm{AdjHom}(v^*,R,\\Psi)\\bigr).\n\\end{cases}\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\beta^\\Sigma_{S,A}&\\coloneqq\\beta^\\Sigma_{S,A}(\\Sigma_{v'},\\Phi^{\\Sigma,v'},\\Sigma_v,\\Phi^{\\Sigma,v}),\\\\\n\\beta^\\Pi_{S,A}&\\coloneqq\\beta^\\Pi_{S,A}(\\Pi_{v'},\\Phi^{\\Pi,v'},\\Pi_v,\\Phi^{\\Pi,v}),\\\\\n\\mathrm{BC}_\\Sigma(p;S)&\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{BC}_\\Sigma(p;S;\\Sigma_{v'},\\Phi^{\\Sigma,v'},\\Sigma_v,\\Phi^{\\Sigma,v}),\\\\\n\\mathrm{BC}_\\Pi(p;S)&\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{BC}_\\Pi(p;S;\\Pi_{v'},\\Phi^{\\Pi,v'},\\Pi_v,\\Phi^{\\Pi,v}).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{BC}(p)\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\exists(\\Sigma_w,\\Pi_w,\\Phi^{\\Sigma,w},\\Phi^{\\Pi,w})_{w\\in\\operatorname{Mor}\\mathcal B})\\Bigl[{}&\n(\\forall w)\\ \\mathrm{AdjHom}(\\Sigma_w,w^*,\\Phi^{\\Sigma,w})\\land\\mathrm{AdjHom}(w^*,\\Pi_w,\\Phi^{\\Pi,w})\\\\\n&\\land(\\forall S=(u',v',v,u)\\in\\operatorname{PB}(\\mathcal B))\\\\\n&\\quad\\mathrm{BC}_\\Sigma(p;S;\\Sigma_{v'},\\Phi^{\\Sigma,v'},\\Sigma_v,\\Phi^{\\Sigma,v})\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\mathrm{BC}_\\Pi(p;S;\\Pi_{v'},\\Phi^{\\Pi,v'},\\Pi_v,\\Phi^{\\Pi,v})\\Bigr],\\\\\n\\mathsf{BC}(p)&\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{BC}(p).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"L'(u')^*A\\to u^*LA","display":false},{"tex":"u^*RA\\to R'(u')^*A","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PB}(\\mathcal B)","display":false}],"bytes":4589,"backlinks":[{"id":"bc55050523e20611","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":