0","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\varphi\\wedge_L\\psi,\\varphi\\vee_L\\psi,\\varphi\\Rightarrow_L\\psi$ 为本页定义的逐点谓词；$\\varphi,\\psi:L\\to\\mathcal P(A)$。$\\mathrm{FOFib}$、$\\mathrm{BC}$、$\\mathrm{SplitTripos}$ 分别采用 [[16-df-first-order-fibration]]、[[16-df-beck-chevalley]]、[[16-df-split-higher-order-fibration]]。分裂取 $\\kappa_A$，泛对象取 $G_A$；量词的对象作用采用下式，箭头作用取相应预序 Hom 中的唯一箭头。"},{"id":"ed457575028b1d57","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{BC}_\\Pi(p_{\\mathcal D};S)$ 采用 [[16-df-beck-chevalley]]，使用本页同一个选定伴随族。$\\mathrm{AdjHom}(F,G,\\Phi)$ 及由 $\\Phi$ 产生的单位、余单位采用 [[16-df-adjoint-functors]]；下文量化的每个 $\\Phi_d$ 都是该定义的候选 Hom 映射族。$\\mathrm{DisplayUnit},\\mathrm{DisplayStrongSum},\\mathrm{DisplayStrongEq},\\mathrm{DisplayProducts},\\mathrm{RCCC}$ 为本页定义；所有态射的复合采用 $\\mathcal B$ 的指定复合。"},{"id":"e39d17458a2b0aa4","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"mate 采用 [[16-df-beck-chevalley]]；$\\mathrm{AdjHom}$ 及其单位、余单位采用 [[16-df-adjoint-functors]]。每个存在量词内的函子族及 Hom 自然双射族同时固定，所有 BC 使用该同一伴随族。"},{"id":"eeefa02192bbb359","anchor":"ref-18","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CCC}$、$\\mathrm{FOFib}$、$\\mathrm{BC}$ 分别采用 [[16-df-ccc-definition]]、[[16-df-first-order-fibration]]、[[16-df-beck-chevalley]]。最后一式的论域为 $p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}$；一般 BC 的可逆性不依赖提升选择。"},{"id":"0632c91c845f3662","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"高阶结构及任意集合函数的量词换基见 [[16-df-higher-order-fibration]]、[[16-df-beck-chevalley]]。"},{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-23","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[16-df-function]]、[[16-df-formula]]、[[16-df-provable]]、[[16-df-satisfaction]]、[[16-df-validity-fo]]、[[16-df-type-interpretation]]、[[16-df-general-quantifier]]、[[16-df-beck-chevalley]]、[[16-df-frobenius]]、[[16-df-regular-category]]、[[16-df-coherent-category]]、[[16-df-first-order-fibration]]、[[16-df-higher-order-fibration]]。"}